### TaxRateSystem - tax catalogue smoke tests (API.md §8, §17 Flow 3)
### Public routes: no token required.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### §8.1 - all ten tax types (summary form; exactly ten, never paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/taxes
Accept: application/json

### §8.2 - personal income tax: six brackets + the canonical ₱600,000 -> ₱62,500 example
GET {{baseUrl}}/taxes/personal_income_tax
Accept: application/json

### §8.3 - bracket table only (VAT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/taxes/vat/brackets
Accept: application/json

### §8.4 - worked example(s) only
GET {{baseUrl}}/taxes/vat/examples
Accept: application/json

### Unknown code -> 404 with message "No tax type with code 'gst'."
GET {{baseUrl}}/taxes/gst
Accept: application/json

